THIRD-PARTY DEPENDENCIES
================================================================================

ProForma has two runtime dependencies, both MIT licensed:

  react, react-dom          https://github.com/facebook/react

The optional AI review server (server/index.mjs) loads @anthropic-ai/sdk
(MIT) only when it is run. It is an optional dependency and the application
is fully functional without it.

Inference prices in src/data/models.ts are Anthropic first-party API list
rates, included for the token calculator. No third-party provider prices are
shipped; see the note in that file.
